s, or asking members to contact off-platform).\n- Contains spam patterns: copy-paste templates, keyword stuffing, repeated phrases, excessive emojis, unrelated links, or incoherent text.\n- Indicates harmful, fraudulent, or rule-breaking intent.", "mcPassingThreshold": 100, "hasOpenEndedQuestion": true}}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://t.me/canonical-main-community', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-11 18:43:26.654676+00', '2026-01-21 17:48:07.163352+00', '{"enabled": true, "sendToBannedUser": true, "triggerOnAutoBan": true, "triggerOnManualBan": true}', NULL, NULL);
